[length:04:13]
[ti:Tiny soldier]
[ar:Aracne Phobia]
[al:EP 1 - The Doll's Vault]
[au:Aracne Phobia]
[lr:Aracne Phobia]
[by:Azaria]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]]
[ve:0.2.4]
[00:01.36]Ha… ha…
[00:04.420]he walks in straight lines…
[00:08.492]like something drew him that way…
[00:24.840]He stands so still
[00:26.310]like nothing leaks
[00:28.114]like all his cracks
[00:29.702]are underneath
[00:31.529]He says “it’s fine”
[00:32.520]he says “it holds”
[00:35.57]but I can hear
[00:36.43]the way it folds
[00:38.716]He looks like code
[00:40.447]that doesn’t crash
[00:42.137]just loops the pain
[00:43.862]and clears the cache
[00:46.475]Behavior stable
[00:47.596]Emotional load contained
[00:50.64]Command integrity
[00:51.320]Successfully maintained
[00:53.277]No visible error
[00:54.860]No system distress
[00:56.838]Subject displays
[00:57.998]Operational success
[00:59.999]If that’s “perfect”
[01:01.947]I don’t want it
[01:03.479]If that’s “strong”
[01:04.822]I’ll break upon it
[01:07.268]Wind him up, he’ll never stop
[01:10.827]tiny soldier, ticking clock
[01:14.572]Say the line, don’t feel a thing
[01:18.139]good boy built for everything
[01:21.633]If he breaks, he won’t be loud
[01:24.780]systems fail but make no sound
[01:28.537]Is that strength or just decay?
[01:31.905]Paint it clean and call it “okay”
[01:36.189]He sees the fire
[01:37.452]and calls it risk
[01:39.504]I see a pulse
[01:40.767]he wants dismissed
[01:42.218]But sometimes he…
[01:44.515]lags behind
[01:45.670]like something else
[01:47.335]is on his mind
[01:49.203]Wet pavement steps
[01:50.122]repeat, repeat
[01:50.918]a word he says
[01:51.804]I cannot read
[01:53.250]“Korzet”… again
[01:56.453]and then it’s gone
[01:57.21]like foreign code
[01:57.908]he’s running on
[01:58.840]His hands go still
[01:59.732]like they remember
[02:01.544]something warm
[02:02.391]inside the pressure
[02:03.574]Like holding shape
[02:05.187]that isn’t here
[02:07.62]like fitting worlds
[02:08.931]inside a sphere
[02:11.213]Emotional deviation
[02:12.989]Leads to system collapse
[02:14.955]Impulse behavior
[02:15.889]Increases critical gaps
[02:18.572]Discipline ensures
[02:19.710]Collective survival
[02:21.309]Attachment risks
[02:22.941]Structural denial
[02:24.672]You call it balance
[02:26.240]I call it fear
[02:27.715]You call it duty
[02:29.770]I disappear
[02:32.379]Wind him up, he’ll never stop
[02:35.516]tiny soldier, perfect cog
[02:39.162]Hold the line until he drops
[02:42.707]no one asks what it cost
[02:46.305]If I felt like that inside
[02:49.452]I’d tear the system open wide
[02:53.241]Better broken, better loud
[02:56.602]than disappearing in a crowd
[03:03.940]Stability—
[03:05.667]control—
[03:07.206]maintain—
[03:09.168]mai—
[03:14.777]What if he doesn’t know
[03:17.868]he’s already gone
[03:21.412]What if “being strong”
[03:24.425]is just… staying wrong
[03:28.742]Wind him up, he’ll never stop
[03:32.160]tiny soldier, hollow core
[03:35.736]Built to hold but not to want
[03:39.123]not to feel, not anymore
[03:42.872]If that’s what you call alive
[03:46.84]I refuse to be that kind
[03:49.752]Let it glitch, let it break
[03:53.134]I choose every wrong I make
[03:56.993]🎵
[04:00.481]System… stable…
[04:04.81]system… st—
[04:07.653]🎵